deb-harden-ssh (1.0.0-1) stable; urgency=low

  * Initial release of deb-harden-ssh package.
  * Add /etc/ssh/sshd_config.d/99-harden-ssh.conf drop-in configuration.
  * Add /etc/fail2ban/jail.d/harden-ssh.conf drop-in configuration.
  * Restrict SSH access to members of the ssh-users system group.
  * Enforce Lynis SSH hardening recommendations (root login, timeouts,
    auth attempts).
  * Add postinst logic to create ssh-users group, validate sshd syntax, and
    reload the service.
  * Add postrm logic to safely handle package removal and notify sysadmin
    on purge.
    (Closes: #100000)

